Modifications from the original:
  - font problems report instead of aborting the export
    (PLAINLY_STRICT_FONTS = true restores upstream behaviour)
  - NFC normalisation added to finalizePath()
  - per-layer read guarded against exceptions
  - cross-check against app.project.usedFonts added
